            <param name="bdr_color_adv" value="#FF95918C" />
          </paramlist><![CDATA[IEEE 09 Test System with GFM, GFL, and SG Models
Date: Fall 2020
Developed by: Rick Wallace Kenyon

Steady state model built by PSCAD, see other note.
All dynamic models in this system were developed and installed by Wallace Kenyon, based on various academic resources. See paper 'Open-Source PSCAD Grid-Following and Grid-Forming and A Benchmark for Zero-Inertia Power System Simulations' for mathematical formulation. This paper has been submitted to the 2021 Kansas Power and Energy Conference.

Please communicate with Wallace about changes to improve the model:
rike4641@colorado.edu, mattime07@gmail.com

]]></Sticky>
